# Modal scroll lock

When a modal, dialog, or overlay is open:

- Always disable background page scroll (html + body).
- Prefer a robust lock: `position: fixed` on `body` with saved `scrollY`, restore on close.
- Also set `overflow: hidden` on `html` and `body`.
- Do not leave the page scrollable behind an open modal on desktop or mobile.
